        "### Testing KinematicAnalyzer on a Video File\n",
        "Below is the code to download a sample cricket bowling action video, run the KinematicAnalyzer frame-by-frame, and output a tracked video with annotated elbow joint angles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
